    metal_gpu_only_cpu_mirror_composite_labelled_device_readback_2026-11-26, 0, "2026-11-26 wm-lane-20261126 source read only (Linux aarch64 host, no Metal device): found by Fable review; not reproduced on hardware here."
    metal_gpu_only_cpu_mirror_composite_labelled_device_readback_2026-11-26, 1, "2026-11-27 W5-3 fix-implemented-verification-pending: added cpu_composite_reason provenance tracking + metal_resolve_gpu_only_readback_source in backend_metal.spl so gpu_only CPU-mirror composites report cpu_mirror (never device_readback); updated metal_engine2d_readback_spec.spl (13/13 PASS on Windows non-macOS host) and added backend_metal_readback_provenance_and_glass_spec.spl (4/4 PASS), backend_metal_hardening_spec.spl (36/36 PASS), backend_metal_device_free_contract_spec.spl (7/7 PASS); waiting-for: macOS Metal verification."
